        "action": "Review police treatment of certain groups or certain behaviours",
        "additional_details": "In our view, examples of two-tier policing include different treatment of certain groups of people, or some behaviour (for example protests and demonstrations), where some people are dealt with more harshly, more robustly, than others by law enforcement.",
        "background": "We call for a review into what we consider to be two tier policing. \r\n",
